# An example of cost averaging.

commodity USD  ; lots:AVERAGE

2024-09-09 * Buy USD, with multiple costs
    assets:bank:JPY
    assets:bank:USD                100 USD @ 150 JPY
    assets:bank:USD                100 USD @ 160 JPY

2024-09-10 * transfer USD
    assets:bank:USD               -200 USD
    assets:broker:USD

2024-09-11 * Buy USD, with multiple costs
    assets:bank:JPY
    assets:bank:USD                100 USD @ 170 JPY
    assets:bank:USD                100 USD @ 180 JPY

comment

With AVERAGE:

